     <P> </P>
<P><FONT size=4>高一、高二的全体同学：</FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=4>    新的学年已经展开，精彩纷呈的高中生活需要我们锻炼多方面的能力，全方位提高自己的素养。我们追求优异的成绩，我们还需要锻炼办事的能力：懂得策划与执行，学会协作与沟通，领悟借鉴与创新，在实践梦想与探索成功的路上体验成长的快乐。</FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=4>    你需要一个平台！我们虚位以待！你敢不敢来试一试？！</FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=4>    你需要一个平台！我们虚位以待！你敢不敢来试一试？！</FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=4>    你需要一个平台！我们虚位以待！你敢不敢来试一试？！一试？！试！！！</FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=4>    请认真阅读《换届选举方案》，填写报名表，于9月28日中午13:00前交团委办公室。</FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=center><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">绍兴一中团学联主席团换届选举方案（草案）</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">一、领导组织</SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black">团学联主席团换届选举工作，由校团委直接领导实施，受校党委的指导与监督。选举产生的新一届学生干部团体，接受校团委领导，开展各项学生工作对校团委负责。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><FONT size=3>二、岗位设置<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></STRONG></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=3>主席团成员五名（其中高一<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>—<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>名），经竞选投票产生后，由团委老师根据主席团成员工作表现，考察讨论明确具体职务（包括：主席一名，团委书记助理一名，副主席两名，主席助理一名）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></STRONG></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">三、报名条件</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black">：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">我校高一、高二在读学生；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">思想进步，政治坚定，品行端正，德育考评等第“良好”以上；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">团结同学，严于律己，群众基础好；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">对学生工作富有热情，服务意识强，勤恳敬业；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma" lang=EN-US>5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">具有较强的组织、表达能力和团队协作的能力；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma" lang=EN-US>6.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #111111; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">学习成绩优秀，综合排名不低于班级前<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>名（重点班不限）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=3>四、换届流程<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></STRONG></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">团学联主席团换届程序分为自荐申请、初选审查、民主选举、组织考核、正式任命五个阶段。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21.55pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.79; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">自荐申请</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">：符合竞选条件的同学应于规定日期前向校团委提交书面申请。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21.55pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.79; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">初选审查</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">：由校团委组织评审组对报名申请的同学进行审核，确定主席团竞选候选人。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21.55pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.79; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">民主选举</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">：由绍兴一中学生代表大会听取候选人的竞选演说（限时三分钟），并进行民主投票，当场唱票，统计票数，依票数高低确定选举结果。学生代表由各班按班级人数比例的<SPAN lang=EN-US>10%</SPAN>推举产生，必须包含班长、团支书。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21.55pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.79; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">组织考核</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">：由校团委对已胜选的候选人进行综合素质考核。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21.55pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.79; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">正式任命</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">：通过校团委考核，并报校党委批准后，任命职务，划分工作职责。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">五、时间安排<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">竞选报名截止日期：<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>28</SPAN>日中午<SPAN lang=EN-US>13:00</SPAN>；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">学生代表大会初步拟定于<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>日中午举行，具体安排另行通知。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">六、附则</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">参加主席团竞选的同学可同时报名参加各部部长选拔，如未当选主席团成员可参加各部部长的公开选拔。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">竞选申请内容包括个人简介，<SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">以及对团学联工作的认识、工作思路和打算等。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">团学联换届选举工作在公平、公正、公开的原则下进行，杜绝一切徇私舞弊的现象。一经发现候选人有拉选票等情况，立即取消候选人资格，并取消其在校学习期间的团委学生会干部的任用资格。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">新一届团学联干部任职后，原任团学联干部随即退任。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold" lang=EN-US>5.</SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">参加竞选的候选人不得作为选举人或代表投票。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>6.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">未尽事宜，由校团委负责解释。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
